    "intro_narrative": "You step into the dimly lit office of Arthur Vance, a private investigator who vanished without a trace three days ago. The air is stale, smelling of old paper and cold coffee. Rain lashes against the frosted glass window. Scattered across his heavy oak desk are remnants of his final, unfinished case—strange devices, locked files, and an unyielding digital trail. The police found nothing, but you know Arthur always left a breadcrumb trail for those who knew how to look. Your objective is to bypass his security measures, access his most closely guarded secrets, and obtain the hidden evidence before whoever took Arthur comes back for you. Time is running out.",
